1
00:00:00,119 --> 00:00:02,276
Hun snakker om IBC-tanken sin hver

2
00:00:02,276 --> 00:00:03,119
sommer.

3
00:00:03,119 --> 00:00:04,759
Slik overrasket jeg henne.

4
00:00:04,759 --> 00:00:07,134
Mannen min elsker hagen sin, og

5
00:00:07,134 --> 00:00:09,739
han har klaget over det samme i to

6
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:10,579
somre.

7
00:00:10,579 --> 00:00:12,939
Alger i regnvannstanken.

8
00:00:12,939 --> 00:00:15,006
Jeg ville gi ham noe han faktisk

9
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:17,009
ville bruke, ikke bare en dings

10
00:00:17,009 --> 00:00:18,899
som ender opp i et skap.

11
00:00:18,899 --> 00:00:21,587
Så jeg bestilte et IBC-tanktrekk

12
00:00:21,587 --> 00:00:23,579
fra Beverbutikken.

13
00:00:23,579 --> 00:00:25,840
Han ble helt overrasket.

14
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,502
En stund trodde han at jeg hadde

15
00:00:27,502 --> 00:00:29,216
glemt problemet han hadde snakket

16
00:00:29,216 --> 00:00:30,599
om hele sommeren.

17
00:00:30,599 --> 00:00:32,816
Nå er tanken beskyttet, vannet er

18
00:00:32,816 --> 00:00:34,967
klart, og han viser den frem til

19
00:00:34,967 --> 00:00:36,279
alle naboene.

20
00:00:36,279 --> 00:00:38,335
Noen ganger er den beste gaven den

21
00:00:38,335 --> 00:00:40,392
som løser et problem noen allerede

22
00:00:40,392 --> 00:00:41,840
har hatt lenge.

23
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,146
Gi bort et IBC-tanktrekk fra

24
00:00:44,146 --> 00:00:45,719
Beverbutikken.

25
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:49,259
Enkel gave, stor takknemlighet.
